{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/83d5cdbe6d257019c3d906910889a5b7.poster.avif?t=1760530280\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/83d5cdbe6d257019c3d906910889a5b7.webm?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/83d5cdbe6d257019c3d906910889a5b7.mp4?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/a4a60a68e9257219d8eeabf55a446e25.avif?t=1760530280\" width=780 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0<strong>Snowfall City</strong> is not only the alpine home of winter, but also the place where people from across the world gather for the annual <strong>Silvergale Cup!</strong>\u00a0Rivalry, tradition, and pride collide in a fierce competition - the ultimate test of skill with the snowball-slinging <strong>snowblaster</strong>. For the Silvergale Champion, it\u2019s not just about the prize money, but the fame and glory...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/b1cb31a6f7a36cee0404108621090915.poster.avif?t=1760530280\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/b1cb31a6f7a36cee0404108621090915.webm?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/b1cb31a6f7a36cee0404108621090915.mp4?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This season, you too are competing - a complete rookie standing in for your talented sister after a nefarious rival had her disqualified on a flimsy excuse. Your family back home could really use the prize winnings, but the climb through the championship challenges is steep, and you\u2019ll need to master your skills quickly\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you have what it takes?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/d8a1eb0d999131a2e922cd7045fb704f.poster.avif?t=1760530280\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/d8a1eb0d999131a2e922cd7045fb704f.webm?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/d8a1eb0d999131a2e922cd7045fb704f.mp4?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frost and Glory is a single-player open-world light rpg. Armed with a scrappy snowblaster and raw determination, you\u2019ll fight against unique enemies in strategic, isometric combat. Unlock abilities and spend skill points as you gain experience, and upgrade to more powerful snowblasters and gear to withstand the ever-toughening trials ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you rise through the ranks, you\u2019ll unlock new districts of Snowfall City to explore, where you\u2019ll discover residents with side-quests to take on, and befriend companions who may join your team. Their support will be crucial on the road to the <strong>Avalanche Arena</strong>, where you\u2019ll finally face your cunning rivals, and the next Silvergale Champion will be decided!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.poster.avif?t=1760530280\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.webm?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.mp4?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/bb2f97cdb4dcf82207fa5f6df4b3d11e.avif?t=1760530280\" width=780 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Snowball Battles</strong> \u2013 Master an expanding arsenal of <strong>snowblasters</strong>, gadgets, and abilities; from ricochet shots to icy barriers, every new skill helps you adapt and outsmart your opponents as you chase the championship title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials &amp; Arenas</strong> \u2013 Face  thematic enemies, bosses and rival teams in tense snowball clashes; hazards, shifting terrain, and mischievous snow imps ensure no two fights are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Progression</strong> \u2013 Level up, shape your stats, and upgrade gear within a fast-paced, light but highly customizable  progression system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Snowfall City</strong> \u2013 A layered alpine town alive with background NPCs, shops, and side quests. Unlock further districts as you progress through the challenges and meet the varied characters of Snowfall City.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Companions\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Befriend companion characters and recruit them to fight by your side; each companion possesses individual personalities and reasons for competing, and they'll offer unique strengths and strategies in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.poster.avif?t=1760530280\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.webm?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.mp4?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891490?t=1760530280","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/f8337d055e535e18f900a2510aa6ab11fe7c1d46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760530280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/f9a16c91c138258aaa2da091ae8a5b782022d9d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760530280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/f9a16c91c138258aaa2da091ae8a5b782022d9d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760530280","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3917210,"d