 team. Their support will be crucial on the road to the <strong>Avalanche Arena</strong>, where you\u2019ll finally face your cunning rivals, and the next Silvergale Champion will be decided!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.poster.avif?t=1760530280\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.webm?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.mp4?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/bb2f97cdb4dcf82207fa5f6df4b3d11e.avif?t=1760530280\" width=780 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Snowball Battles</strong> \u2013 Master an expanding arsenal of <strong>snowblasters</strong>, gadgets, and abilities; from ricochet shots to icy barriers, every new skill helps you adapt and outsmart your opponents as you chase the championship title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials &amp; Arenas</strong> \u2013 Face  thematic enemies, bosses and rival teams in tense snowball clashes; hazards, shifting terrain, and mischievous snow imps ensure no two fights are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Progression</strong> \u2013 Level up, shape your stats, and upgrade gear within a fast-paced, light but highly customizable  progression system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Snowfall City</strong> \u2013 A layered alpine town alive with background NPCs, shops, and side quests. Unlock further districts as you progress through the challenges and meet the varied characters of Snowfall City.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Companions\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Befriend companion characters and recruit them to fight by your side; each companion possesses individual personalities and reasons for competing, and they'll offer unique strengths and strategies in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.poster.avif?t=1760530280\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.webm?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.mp4?t=1760530280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Olipa Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/01c2970584597149736e9b22db3b4900f466cd4d/header.jpg?t=1760530280","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891490/582479558/a7db77b24edb90934c0c990ceaaf4fb3156bdcfd/1759740568/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760376491","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891490/582479558/a7db77b24edb90934c0c990ceaaf4fb3156bdcfd/1759740568/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760376491","highlight":true,